7,"Miao, Eastern Huishui | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/hme/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..THpUcd87shyiDpiHdLaVVsNTLSviteAkjBMnLgRnXw0,"Eastern Huishui Miao is an endangered indigenous language of China. It belongs to the Hmong-Mien language family and is part of the Hmong macrolanguage. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by a decreasing number of young people.","Miao, Eastern Huishui",Hmong-Mien
